@NWSDB.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5261

### Health check
GET {{NWSDB.API_HostAddress}}/healthz

### Register a customer (role is always Customer)
POST {{NWSDB.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_customer",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "phone": "0771234567",
  "password": "StrongPass#2026"
}

### Login
POST {{NWSDB.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_customer",
  "password": "StrongPass#2026"
}
